{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-09_beg","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":245,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_main_16-09_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-9","storyName":"疯人的辩护","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在矿工领袖雷尔金的噩梦之中，他们从未真正杀死那个内卫。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_16-09_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_16-08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["年轻的矿工","恐惧的矿工","？？？","矿工","“皇帝的利刃”","军人？","“黑色的雪”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act37d0d0/m_bat_act37d0d0_02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的矿工","text":"不要......不......","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_heavy","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的矿工","text":"唔！","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"text","text":"你看到年轻的女人倒在你的眼前，黑色的长矛从她的尸体上慢慢“生长”出来。","id":24},{"type":"text","text":"在她很快就不再动弹的身体旁边，另一个人弹动着双脚，试图将自己推离这片危险的区域。","id":25},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的矿工","text":"怪、怪物......！","id":28},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgopenftstp","volume":"1","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"background","id":33},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","layer":"1","id":34},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_8_29.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"0","id":35},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","block":"false","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":37},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"黑色不断逼近着。黑色、黑色、黑色。一切都是黑色，只有血是鲜红的。你甚至无法确认自己所面对的是否为活物。","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不要怕——不要退后！","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"还有力气的，都站起来——","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矿工","text":"啊！！！！","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"黑色继续从尸山血海中蹚过。地上有矿工，有卫兵，也有普通的乌萨斯人。","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"不间断的尖叫声使你清楚，无论自己是否转身逃跑，那些几乎凭空出现的长矛都会将你追上。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"于是你只能眼看着穿透了无数躯体的长矛不断从大地之中拔起，几乎要将整个地面覆盖。","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"——","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_daggerslow","volume":"1","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"突然，一根根长矛从尸山上抽离，在黑影的手中重组成了一柄长剑。","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"而后那辨不清话音的存在将手中长剑高高举起，指向你。","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"image","id":57},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"你想要站着死去。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不......我不会死......","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不会死在这里。","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"不错的期许。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"可惜，不切实际。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":70},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldman_walk","volume":"1","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1964_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"......","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"那是......？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1976_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1.5","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1976_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人？","text":"雷尔金，我们来帮你！","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人？","text":"雷尔金——","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你们——列尼亚，怎么是你？","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人？","text":"我们帮你！","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你们来了，你们来帮我了！我的战友，你们也在这里——","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我们并肩作战，就像以前那样！","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人？","text":"就像以前那样！","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"来！帮我围住他，就像从前那样！一个人倒下了，另一个人就填上他的位置；一群人倒下了，另一群人就填上他们的位置！","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"跟在我身后！","id":98},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"愚蠢......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"你能感到身后的热源，灼烧感仿佛滚烫的炉火在身上蔓延。那些使你血液沸腾的，也使你双眼清明，他们高喊你的名字，将你向前推去。","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"在这坚实的簇拥之下，你一跃而起，对准那黑色身躯上状似胸腔的位置——","id":104},{"type":"text","text":"捅下去。","id":105},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":108},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"3","block":"false","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_audience_chaos","volume":"1","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":112},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1.8","yScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.8","duration":"0.4","block":"false","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"background","id":116},{"type":"bgeffect","id":117},{"type":"image","image":"66_i01","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"0","y":"-100","id":118},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.6","yScaleFrom":"1.6","xScaleTo":"1.5","yScaleTo":"1.5","duration":"10","block":"false","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_piercechest","volume":"1","id":121},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"——死——","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"——","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"呵......","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"没有血滴落的声音。没有抽搐的反应。","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"只是刀刃的阻力在一点点变小，直至完全消失。","id":129},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"image","image":"66_i01","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":131},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"原来......原来......","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"......“迦弗里伊尔”——","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"最后一个音节说出口，原本被黑影撑起的制服突然像脱了力一般，再无反抗的痕迹。","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"你终结了这个怪物。以勇气，以果决，以胆魄。","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"以不存在的“友人”的支持。","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"image","id":145},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_5_7_shining.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_atmosphere_horror","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"at","id":148},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"at","fadetime":"2","id":149},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dim_openeye","layer":"1","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"subtitle","text":"呼......呼......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":153},{"type":"subtitle","text":"双手好沉。这是哪里？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":154},{"type":"subtitle","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"“——倒下了，他倒下了！”","id":157},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......谁？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":161},{"type":"subtitle","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"at","fadetime":"2","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"“雷尔金，你——我们，我们杀死了——”","id":165},{"type":"text","text":"“我们杀死了他！！”","id":166},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"subtitle","text":"杀死了谁？这些黑色的......雪......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":170},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不，还不够。死了一个挡路的，也还有这些到处都是的、恼人的雪......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":171},{"type":"subtitle","text":"怎么也不会停下的雪。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":172},{"type":"subtitle","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"“雷尔金，雷尔金？我们接下来怎么办？”","id":175},{"type":"text","text":"“雷尔金——”","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"at","fadetime":"2","id":178},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus","volume":"1","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"image","id":182},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":183},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":184},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","y":"0","fadetime":"0","id":185},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"200","xTo":"-200","duration":"30","id":186},{"type":"bg","id":187,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"0.1","block":"false"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1976_1#1$1","bstart":"0.1","bend":"0.3","posfrom":"0,-160","posto":"0,-160","duration":"4","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.4","duration":"0","id":189},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_whitemask","layer":"2","id":190},{"type":"focusparam","blur":"false","effect":"Grayscale","id":191},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人？","text":"雷尔金！","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我是......","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矿工","text":"雷尔金！雷尔金！","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"人群如潮水一般涌向你。他们将你托起，又将你拉下。这种失重的感觉，你从前也曾有过。","id":198},{"type":"text","text":"人群欢呼，人群吵嚷。震耳欲聋的回响中，绝不应出现在这里的人喊出你的名字。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人？","text":"——雷尔金——","id":201},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_whitemask","layer":"2","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"bgeffect","id":207},{"type":"background","id":208},{"type":"focusparam","id":209},{"type":"curtain","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"你闭上眼睛，随他的话语回到那片森林中。一支边防驻军，一次有去无回的任务。","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"现在，你不在那里。","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"赢了......","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我们赢了。","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_atmosphere_horror","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"at","id":216},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"at","fadetime":"2","id":217},{"type":"bg","id":218,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"4","block":"false"},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":219},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":220},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"升起又坠落的瞬间，你看向远处那团仍未散尽的黑尘。","id":224},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"at","fadetime":"2","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“黑色的雪”","text":"......","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的尘烟，如同无数条细小蜿蜒的根须，从那制服的每一个孔隙中钻出，贪婪地缠绕着、覆盖着、吸附着，直到将其完全包覆。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"在黑烟的包裹下，那制服渐渐又显现出人形，仿佛——","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smokeconverge","volume":"1","id":231},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_8_30.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"3","id":232},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"仿佛他从未死去。","id":235},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"background","id":241},{"type":"image","id":242}],"characters":["年轻的矿工","恐惧的矿工","？？？","矿工","“皇帝的利刃”","军人？","“黑色的雪”"]}